## Health Checks

The API provides health and ping endpoints:

```
GET /health    → { "s": 1, "runtime": "edge" }
GET /ping      → { "pong": true, "ts": 1234567890 }
```

## API Status

The root endpoint provides system status:

```
GET /          → { "name": "lament-api", "version": "1.2.0", "status": "operational" }
```

When maintenance mode is active, the status changes to `"maintenance"` with a description.

## Maintenance Status

Check maintenance state:

```
GET /maintenance
```

Returns the maintenance state for both the API and frontend services.
